    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78942" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παράτονος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stretched beside</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. χέρες</span> hands <i>hanging down
				by the side</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				399
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>ill-sounding</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διάλεκτος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hsch.
				</span></i>
			
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαρβαρισμός</span>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>ill-strung</i>, of a bow, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παράτονόν σοι ἐγένετο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ps.-Callisth.
					1.31
				</span></i>
			.</div>
